==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Nagano Prefecture'''.
*The noodle dish on Nagano Prefecture's prefecture is Shinshu soba, a kind of [[wikipedia:Soba|soba]] (thin noodles made from buckwheat flour) for which Nagano is especially famous.

